<c:Classes>
<o:Class Id="o208">
<a:ObjectID>95C524C6-C6D3-4A7C-B4EA-D51A99B1AE06</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Asset</a:Name>
<a:Code>Asset</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> A tangible resource of the utility, including power system equipment, cabinets, buildings, etc.  For electrical network equipment, the role of the asset is defined in the Wires Model (refer to IEC 61970-301).  This role is associated with an asset description, which places emphasis on the  physical characteristics of the equipment fulfilling that role.  This is the parent class for asset sub classes.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o228">
<a:ObjectID>DB76FA5D-B02F-4F9B-A604-61865DCD1B8E</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>code</a:Name>
<a:Code>code</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Code for this type of asset.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o229">
<a:ObjectID>77A3EA7E-DC75-4439-B49D-D9C1EAC6C88B</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>utc</a:Name>
<a:Code>utc</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Uniquely Tracked Commodity (UTC) number.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o230">
<a:ObjectID>69FB19BE-BC7C-47F7-A9D6-CD0803FC6032</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>serialNumber</a:Name>
<a:Code>serialNumber</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Serial number of asset.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o231">
<a:ObjectID>3908549A-3781-43D6-B554-59A6515CD414</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>assetType</a:Name>
<a:Code>assetType</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> General classification for this for this type of asset.  Note that specializations of TypeAsset have a type that is intended to be unique to that type of asset, which can be enumerated for that type of asset in accordance with a utility&#39;s standards.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o232">
<a:ObjectID>D85AA892-2644-4461-BEE6-11AB8189EE80</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>manufacturedDate</a:Name>
<a:Code>manufacturedDate</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Data asset was manufactured.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o233">
<a:ObjectID>A609F585-2C54-4816-860B-9AC6FC395F6E</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>critical</a:Name>
<a:Code>critical</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> True if asset is considered critical for some reason.  For example, a pole with critical attachments.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>boolean</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o234">
<a:ObjectID>1CAEB2DB-A011-4838-8EFA-0198067AEB36</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>condition</a:Name>
<a:Code>condition</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Condition of asset in inventory or at time of installation.  Examples include new, rebuilt, overhaul required, other.  Refer to inspection data for information on the most current condition of the asset.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o235">
<a:ObjectID>EB12CA5F-79C6-4D18-81BC-0990ED90CF69</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>assetUsage</a:Name>
<a:Code>assetUsage</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Asset usage.  Examples include: Distribution Overhead, Distribution Underground, Transmission, Substation, Streetlight, Customer Substation, Unknown, Other.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o236">
<a:ObjectID>9745AD57-976B-4B59-83B8-591BE784CC2A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>purchasePrice</a:Name>
<a:Code>purchasePrice</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Purchase price (amount, units) of asset.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Money</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o237">
<a:ObjectID>572D5FBB-0BD5-449E-A090-3DD9A1CC22A9</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>testStatus</a:Name>
<a:Code>testStatus</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>True  if asset has passed acceptance test and may be placed in or is in service.  It is returned to a false state if asset is removed from service and is required to be tested again before being placed back in service, possibly in a new location. The date of each acceptance test (device may go through multiple test during its life cycle) is determined in AssetStatus.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>boolean</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o238">
<a:ObjectID>3DEE6E2F-6270-4C06-A76F-F0992BA18156</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>statusDate</a:Name>
<a:Code>statusDate</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Date status of association was entered.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o239">
<a:ObjectID>9A8F5F6A-0DA7-415D-84A5-86CA540ECB01</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>currentStatus</a:Name>
<a:Code>currentStatus</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Status at the time of &quot;statusDate.&quot;  Asset is new construction (installed, ready to be placed in operation), in-service, decommissioned (out-of-service), removed, existing, proposed abandoned, proposed install, proposed remove, proposed replace, unknown, other.

For history of status changes, refer to assoicated activity records.
</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o240">
<a:ObjectID>8F817AA3-ED22-4851-99B6-79AA9D360B95</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>lotNumber</a:Name>
<a:Code>lotNumber</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Even for the same model and version number, many assets are manufactured in lots.  the lotNumber identifies the specific lot for this asset.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o241">
<a:ObjectID>8D1C9FDA-C72C-48BE-B071-FC26CC5EE7BB</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>installationDate</a:Name>
<a:Code>installationDate</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Date current installation was completed, which may not be the same as the in-service date.  Asset may have been installed at other locations previously.  Value is null if asset is (1) not currently installed (e.g., stored in a depot) or (2) not intended to be installed (e.g., vehicle, tool).</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o242">
<a:ObjectID>EF3382DF-1227-49B5-B53B-D7537781EE95</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>phases</a:Name>
<a:Code>phases</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>&quot;As built&quot; phase or phases that the asset is associatied with.  &quot;N/A&quot; is the value when not applicable. &quot;N/S is the value for a phase oriented device that is not in service (not connected to a phase or phases). 
Possible values { ABCN , ABC, ABN, ACN, BCN, AB, AC, BC, AN, BN, CN, A, B, C, N, N/A, N/S }.
</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>PhaseCode</a:DataType>
<a:InitialValue>&quot;N/S&quot;</a:InitialValue>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o243">
<a:ObjectID>27E203A6-2193-4571-9C38-0F9F5BA92AF7</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>application</a:Name>
<a:Code>application</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The way this particular asset is being used in this installation.  For example, the application of a bushing when attached to a specific transformer winding would be one of the following: H1, H2, H3, H0, X1, X2, X3, X0, Y1, Y2, Y3, Y0.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o244">
<a:ObjectID>322B0F7F-5550-4473-94C6-4714E1ADEC63</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>initialLossOfLife</a:Name>
<a:Code>initialLossOfLife</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Zero for new devices.  Whenver an asset is reconditioned, this is the percentage off expected life for the asset when it was new.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>PerCent</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o203">
