<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An AssetCatalogueItem provides pricing and other relevant information about a specific manufacturer&#39;s product, an AssetModel, and its price from a given supplier.  A single AssetModel may be availble from multiple suppliers.  Note that manufacturer and supplier are both types of organisation, which the association is inherited from Document.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
