<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The  unit cost for an asset model from a specific supplier..  It is either for a unit cost or cost per unit length.  Cost is for material or asset only and does not include labor to install/construct or configure it.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Money</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
