<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Status of the PowerSystemResource at the time of &quot;statusDate.&quot;  This status is regarding the role (vs. the status of the physical asset performing the PowerSystemResource role).  Current status may be: planned, in-service, proposed remove, proposed replace, out-of-service, unknown, other.

For history of status changes, refer to assoicated activity records.
</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
