<a:Code>waterMeter</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>TRUE when the meter, despite its other capabilities, also has the hardware present to provide the capacity to accumulate data that originates at a water meter. The meter may have an optional AMR module installed internally. If so, the flag is used to describe the collective capability of the assembly. The flag describes the capability exists within the asset whether it is actually utilized (wired) or not.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Boolean</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
