<a:Comment>The duration of the Load Profile or Interval data measured in minutes. Sixty minutes is quite common, but some products support 30, 15, 10, and even 5 minutes.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Integer</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
