<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Real-time pricing signals and/or schedules can be sent to a meter via an automated meter reading (AMR) system.  This can be accomplished based on the price, start time and end time specified in an instance of PriceSignal or by using the price in an instance of PriceSignal associated an instance of Interval.

</a:Comment>
