<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The price of energy according to tarrifs for a specified set of  conditions.  The price will apply for the period specified by StartTime and EndTime, or if these fields are null, for the associated Interval. </a:Comment>
