<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A physical Faultindicator, which is often used for FLISR (Fault Location, Isolation and Restoration) purposes, assisting with the dispatch of crews to “most likely” part of the network (i.e. assists with determining circuit section where the fault most likely happened).</a:Comment>
