<c:Classes>
<o:Class Id="o1350">
<a:ObjectID>78943329-4671-4C35-8FDA-888AA8514A04</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>DuctBank</a:Name>
<a:Code>DuctBank</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> A duct bank may contain many ducts.  Each duct contains individual lines that are expressed as linear assets (thereby describing each line&#39;s physical asset characteristics), which are each associated with ACLineSegments and other classes describing their electrical characteristics.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o1377">
<a:ObjectID>847466E6-D2F3-42CE-A575-18534F7B606F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>numDucts</a:Name>
<a:Code>numDucts</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Number of ducts in duct bank.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Integer</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o1378">
<a:ObjectID>F22FAD72-C6DC-4DCF-9F99-BA54E5FC1E0F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>numCircuits</a:Name>
<a:Code>numCircuits</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Number of circuits in duct bank.  Refer to associations between a duct (LinearAsset) and an ACLineSegment to understand which circuits are in which ducts.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Integer</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o1348">
<a:ObjectID>5682398A-E89A-480F-9BEB-622AA896CBA3</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>StructureSupport</a:Name>
<a:Code>StructureSupport</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Anchors and Guys are types of Support for Structures (&quot;anchor&quot; or &quot;guy&quot; should be specified in the &quot;type&quot; field inherited from Asset).  Anchors are used to hold poles secure.  Anchor type may be concrete, helix, multi-helix, rod, screw, other, unknown.
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o1379">
<a:ObjectID>1EA06DEE-ACE5-4F8F-8A3D-4A4DA8DAB5F9</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>size</a:Name>
<a:Code>size</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Size of anchor or guy.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o1380">
<a:ObjectID>E0B8A896-115E-4152-AC91-3DE59097042E</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>direction</a:Name>
<a:Code>direction</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Direction, specified in degress, of supporting anchor or guy.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AngleDegrees</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o1381">
<a:ObjectID>30568D79-7B0D-4198-A246-D38179156F36</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>length</a:Name>
<a:Code>length</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Length of anchor lead or guy.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ShortLength</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o1382">
<a:ObjectID>9CDF0B48-FBD2-45B1-81A5-D7C84C65444D</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>numRods</a:Name>
<a:Code>numRods</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Number of rods used for an anchor.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Integer</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o1383">
<a:ObjectID>B890243B-17F0-48D0-97B3-9654B0675FA6</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>rodLength</a:Name>
<a:Code>rodLength</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Length of rod used for an anchor.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ShortLength</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o1355">
<a:ObjectID>68D5A0BA-17C8-489A-8FEA-25997758C8EC</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>LinearConductorAsset</a:Name>
<a:Code>LinearConductorAsset</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A conductor asset is the physical asset used to perform the conductor&#39;s role. </a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o1384">
<a:ObjectID>EF2206AA-51C4-4184-A58D-E1A590A09777</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>insulated</a:Name>
<a:Code>insulated</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Condition is true if linear asset has an insulator around the core material.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>boolean</a:DataType>
