<o:Class Id="o1703">
<a:ObjectID>336F75D0-55A0-49FB-A012-00903FE46A62</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Connection</a:Name>
<a:Code>Connection</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A structure can have multiple connection points for electrical connections (e.g. line) each with multiple mounting points, one for each phase. e.g. a Tower may have three Connections, two with three mounting points, one for each phase and a third with a single mounting point for the neutral line. A pole, on the other hand, may have a single Connection with one, two or three mounting points depending on whether it is carrying 1,2 or 3 phases.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o1705">
<a:ObjectID>EAA03269-3729-46E2-A222-22103BFE98A9</a:ObjectID>
