<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Documentation for generic transformers that may be used for various purposes such as work planning. The operating voltages can be found via the ElectricalProperties class. e.g. a two winding transformer will have two instances of ElectricalProperties and the primary/secondaryWinding can be found from the ratedKV attributes of each and the ElecTAElecPropRole used to define which is the primaryWinding and which is the secondaryWinding</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
