<o:Class Id="o2012">
<a:ObjectID>42659211-C2B8-4B3A-81B1-D4350C6D0A91</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Interval</a:Name>
<a:Code>Interval</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An interval defines a time period that occurs on a periodic basis.  This is used, for example, to configure Interval Meters.  An interval meter supports multiple intervals, providing separate measurements for each one.  Different rates may apply for each interval.
Note that the &quot;Interval&quot; class is intended to govern the internal behavior of the object it is associated with.  The time at which something is to be done to the object, for example the reading of an interval meter, is to be accomplished through a &quot;ScheduledEvent.&quot;
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o2075">
<a:ObjectID>EBEC0983-704E-4E62-AE2F-B82E847233F4</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>length</a:Name>
<a:Code>length</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The time interval specified in seconds.  A device like a meter may have multiple interval resolutions (e.g., 1, 5, 15, 30, or 60 minutes).

</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Seconds</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2076">
<a:ObjectID>2D2E9A8A-D531-43BD-9F58-89C2DBF8AAF5</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>offset</a:Name>
<a:Code>offset</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The offset from midnight (i.e., 0 hours, 0 minutes, 0 seconds) for the interval to begin.

</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Seconds</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2077">
<a:ObjectID>78900559-58E5-4526-88BF-CF77A5B03F85</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>intervalCode</a:Name>
<a:Code>intervalCode</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Code for this interval type.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o2007">
<a:ObjectID>D8E93F7D-6946-4370-BCCD-F0C2786EE162</a:ObjectID>
