<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Price curve for specifying the cost of energy (X) at points in time (y1) according to a prcing structure, which is based on a tariff.</a:Comment>
