<c:Classes>
<o:Class Id="o2174">
<a:ObjectID>21014362-1F76-4E3F-9785-E4F445A6097E</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>ActivityRecord</a:Name>
<a:Code>ActivityRecord</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An ActivityRecord records activity for an Asset, Location, PowerSystemResource, Customer, ErpContact (e.g.,  operator, market participant, etc.), or other object at a point in time.  An activity may be for an event that has already occurred or for a planned activity.  
The PowerSystemResource relationship records events regarding the logical function being provided by the resource in the electrical network (independent of the particular asset providing the function).  The Asset relationship records history about the particular equipment, independent of where it is currently being used in the electrical network.   The Location relationship records events associated with the geographical location.  The Customer relationship records history regarding the customer independent of the logical network or particular assets being used to serve the customer.
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o2189">
<a:ObjectID>A82A3DA9-4B3F-4853-B07A-A3E61AC2DF3B</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>status</a:Name>
<a:Code>status</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Status at the time of &quot;statusDateTime.&quot;  For an asset, this is new construction (installed, ready to be placed in operation), in-service, decommissioned (out-of-service), removed, existing, proposed abandoned, proposed install, proposed remove, proposed replace, unknown, other.
</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2190">
<a:ObjectID>550FDABC-590B-428C-9B0A-434F49C46165</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>statusReason</a:Name>
<a:Code>statusReason</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Reason code or explanation for why object went to this status.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2191">
<a:ObjectID>E9ACE80F-8C81-4ED8-ACEC-B5753BA2BE03</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>remarks</a:Name>
<a:Code>remarks</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Text that was recorded at the time specified in &quot;statusDateTime.&quot;
</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2192">
<a:ObjectID>3948AD36-BCE9-4891-A6B6-B2247EF86402</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>statusDateTime</a:Name>
<a:Code>statusDateTime</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Status as of this time and date.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o2172">
<a:ObjectID>CB59CC0B-F19D-44C7-9CD7-E6447F3C78CB</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>History</a:Name>
<a:Code>History</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> List of Documents and/or Events which form a history.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o2175">
<a:ObjectID>B2DED217-936C-4429-8286-90C65196396C</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>TimePoint</a:Name>
<a:Code>TimePoint</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A point in time within a sequence of points in time relative to a TimeSchedule.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o2193">
<a:ObjectID>4A54B2B0-909D-4154-A829-CF1F12F778D9</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>relativeTimeInterval</a:Name>
<a:Code>relativeTimeInterval</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A point in time relative to a scheduled start time (TimeSchedule.subjectStatusDate).  Null if TimePoint is an absolute time or sequence based.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Seconds</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2194">
<a:ObjectID>988A8AC3-746E-4455-8C1A-AD9B04CCC5BE</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>absoluteTime</a:Name>
<a:Code>absoluteTime</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The absolute time and date for this time point. Typically manually entered if TimePoint is calendar based, derived if interval based or sequence based.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2195">
<a:ObjectID>EC2DD0DA-2835-41BD-9BEF-9B51BAFE7DDC</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>sequenceNumber</a:Name>
<a:Code>sequenceNumber</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The relative sequence number for this time point.  Null if TimePoint is interval based or an absolute time.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2196">
<a:ObjectID>85F7601A-3064-460B-9F81-A5C48B5E14BC</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>windowStart</a:Name>
<a:Code>windowStart</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Beginning of the window of time that this time point is valid.  For example, seasonal, only on weekends, not on weekends, only 8:00 to 5:00, etc.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2197">
<a:ObjectID>F2435E5E-4520-4475-8D99-AA70C6A030A6</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>windowEnd</a:Name>
<a:Code>windowEnd</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>End of the window of time that this time point is valid.  </a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o2173">
<a:ObjectID>B44D5C4D-ADBD-41E4-B137-DCF2AB749526</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>TimeSchedule</a:Name>
<a:Code>TimeSchedule</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A &quot;schedule&quot; is used for anything that needs to be described in terms of how it changes through time.  An object of this class is used to perform a single-valued function of time. 

</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o2198">
<a:ObjectID>ECD3EF81-177F-470A-A0D8-B31667086C8A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>timeScheduleType</a:Name>
<a:Code>timeScheduleType</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Type of time schedule such as: periodic (hourly, daily, weekly, monthly, etc.), day of the month, by date, calendar (specific times and dates).</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2199">
<a:ObjectID>C0D70D7B-48B8-4C0A-AC6C-E26A2E1B8E8C</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>recurrencePattern</a:Name>
<a:Code>recurrencePattern</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Specifies the interval at which an appointment repeats.   Example include: first Monday of every month; last day of the month; etc.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2200">
<a:ObjectID>DF3B55AB-60DA-4BCF-8176-266B38B17323</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>recurrencePeriod</a:Name>
<a:Code>recurrencePeriod</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Seconds between time points, from the beinning of one period to the beginning of the next period.  Note that a device like a meter may have multiple interval periods (e.g., 1, 5, 15, 30, or 60 minutes).</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Seconds</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2201">
<a:ObjectID>FD7AF487-7D53-4438-9131-70697ED9E365</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>scheduleStartDate</a:Name>
<a:Code>scheduleStartDate</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Schedule date.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2202">
<a:ObjectID>82E9E7D1-9DDF-4F20-B92F-646F7F11268F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>scheduleFinishDate</a:Name>
<a:Code>scheduleFinishDate</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Scheduled finish date.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2203">
<a:ObjectID>C6689CE6-92AB-406B-8390-7FC3DCEDF644</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>offset</a:Name>
<a:Code>offset</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The offset from midnight (i.e., 0 hours, 0 minutes, 0 seconds) for the periodic time points to begin.  For example, for an interval meter that is set up for five minute intervals, setting recurrencePeriod=300 (5 minutes) and offset=120 (2 minutes) would result in scheduled events to read the meter executing at 2, 7, 12, 17, 22, 27, 32, 37, 42, 47, 52, and 57 minutes past each hour.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Seconds</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o2176">
<a:ObjectID>8B2B04A7-A1EF-43EE-A7CF-6273DFD29A14</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>ScheduledEvent</a:Name>
<a:Code>ScheduledEvent</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Signifies an event to trigger one or more activities, such as reading a meter, recalculating a bill, requesting work, when generating units must be scheduled for maintenance, when a transformers is scheduled to be refurbished, etc..</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o2204">
<a:ObjectID>0B1197D4-80EC-4830-A7D6-D1F26FFFD8F9</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>eventType</a:Name>
<a:Code>eventType</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The type of event that has been scheduled.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o2205">
<a:ObjectID>B6FD6E9C-DC3F-4CD0-93DF-E0909359EF88</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>eventDuration</a:Name>
<a:Code>eventDuration</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Duration of the scheduled event, for example, the time to ramp between values.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Seconds</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o2177">
<a:ObjectID>6260A2B0-46CE-4BCD-B447-BE7956AF5441</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>ScheduleParameters</a:Name>
