<o:Class Id="o2225">
<a:ObjectID>74246790-2871-4574-9BCC-81EBB930E7A8</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>gml_Feature</a:Name>
<a:Code>gml_Feature</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Feature is used for rendering of an object. 

To facilitate the economic use of widely available graphical tools and applications, the Geography Markup Language (GML) is intended to be used for the management of graphical information.  GML is an XML grammar written in XML Schema for the modelling, transport, and storage of geographic information. It was created by the Open GIS Consortium and is standardized through ISO. 
</a:Comment>
