<o:Class Id="o2375">
<a:ObjectID>29692636-B554-4DEE-BBAA-ADFB92936E5B</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Location</a:Name>
<a:Code>Location</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The place, scene, or point of something  where someone or something has been, is, and/or will be at a given moment in time.  It may be the spatial location of an actual or planned structure or set of point-oriented structures (as a substation, structure, building, town, etc.), which may be defined as a point or polygon.  It may also be the path of a underground or overhead conductor. </a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o2397">
<a:ObjectID>86E6C796-40FB-4EDD-AF8E-CD6B106F25A4</a:ObjectID>
