<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> A grant provides a right, as defined by type, for a parcel of land.  Note that the association to Location, Asset, Organisation, etc. for the Grant is inherited from Agreement, a type of Document.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
