<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> A right-of-way (ROW) is for land where it is lawful to use for a public road, an electric power line, etc. Note that the association to Location, Asset, Organisation, etc. for the Grant is inherited from Agreement, a type of Document.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
