<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The relationship between one Location and another Location.  One &quot;roleType&quot; is &quot;Directions,&quot; for which an additional attribute is provided  for providing a textual description for navigating from one location to another location.
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o2417">
<a:ObjectID>D6F7762C-EF01-4F7B-8F84-2DA38388FA07</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>directions</a:Name>
<a:Code>directions</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Detailed directional information.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o2371">
<a:ObjectID>DA50D2C5-AEBF-4FC1-8056-F5F293A118C3</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Route</a:Name>
<a:Code>Route</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A route that is followed, for example by a service crews and meter readers.

</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o2369">
<a:ObjectID>9A589D01-02B6-4E27-BB80-57E54A99080F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>RedLine</a:Name>
<a:Code>RedLine</a:Code>
