<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>In addition to providing physical location information, real world objects of the CIM may also be represented on various types of displays, diagrams, maps, etc. through the concept of a diagram object, which is a specialization of Location.  Note that a manner for accomplishing this is elaborated on in the &quot;GML Support&quot; package.
</a:Comment>
