<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A Map is a type of diagram that is usually printed on paper.  It normally depicts part of the earth&#39;s surface, showing utility assets, right of ways, topological data, coordinates, grids, etc.  Maps vary depending on wether they are used for dispatch, design, schematic, etc.</a:Comment>
