<o:Class Id="o3270">
<a:ObjectID>56D48643-415B-4497-93A6-4C324A7DDA95</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>SafetyDocument</a:Name>
<a:Code>SafetyDocument</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> A safety document is used during the course of work on the electrical system for safety purposes. There are many types of safety documents that could be defined based upon organisational practices.
Note: ClearanceTag is a special case of a Safety Document.
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o3269">
<a:ObjectID>F26F90FC-2E47-4AEC-9BF9-C0A0CE80C2A9</a:ObjectID>
