<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> A single step within a SwitchingSchedule. Could be a switching operation, applying a network alteration or issuing a safety document.

Note: Inherited name from Naming.name is used to hold Sequence Number. 
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
