<o:Class Id="o3454">
<a:ObjectID>0852EB86-2685-449B-B2C5-907FD0996BE1</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>TroubleTicket</a:Name>
<a:Code>TroubleTicket</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> A trouble ticket is a document which is used to report electrical trouble. The trouble may either be an outage or non-outage problem, such as power quality.  It must be always be associated with an Incident Record.

Note that a separate Activity Record is created for each call associated with an instance of Trouble Ticket.  The time of a call is stored in ActivityRecord.createdOn and comments are recorded in ActivityRecord.remarks.
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o3468">
<a:ObjectID>FB3E1418-8A47-428C-B6CE-7190BDBF9402</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>typeOfTrouble</a:Name>
<a:Code>typeOfTrouble</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Code which describes the type of trouble.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o3469">
<a:ObjectID>9738935A-B149-4A42-92C4-C2F80C2C39FE</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>timeOfComm</a:Name>
<a:Code>timeOfComm</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Time trouble call first received.  The time of subsequent calls by the same customer for the same trouble are recorded in associated Activity Records.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o3470">
<a:ObjectID>E55E42D2-1E4B-44CF-9C37-01F7FFD83631</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>priority</a:Name>
<a:Code>priority</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Priority of trouble call.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>EnumeratedType</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o3471">
<a:ObjectID>E150241B-A662-4E09-A850-FCA3992641DF</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>restorationTime</a:Name>
<a:Code>restorationTime</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> Time of restoration of resolution of trouble.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o3472">
<a:ObjectID>3E45FCA3-565E-4881-A9BD-6DA4BD298E11</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>hazardCode</a:Name>
<a:Code>hazardCode</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Code for a reported hazard condition.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o3473">
<a:ObjectID>0C700209-73E4-458B-9EB9-62789E849D84</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>commBackERT</a:Name>
<a:Code>commBackERT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Flag set true if person reporting trouble requested a communication back when sigificant information became available about cause of the outage and the estimated restoration time.  The person and their contact information is maintained in the assoicated Customer informaiton.  Communication back results are recorded in an assoicated ActivityRecord.remarks.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>boolean</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o3474">
<a:ObjectID>D7330BBF-DBDA-432B-8372-0C4BCA3A451F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>commBackRestore</a:Name>
<a:Code>commBackRestore</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Flag set true if person reporting trouble requested a communication back when to confirm power has been restored.  The person and their contact information is maintained in the assoicated Customer informaiton.  communication back results are recorded in an assoicated ActivityRecord.remarks.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>boolean</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o3475">
<a:ObjectID>DFA3A8BA-FE88-454E-8D19-5BE3B9327AA7</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>eRT</a:Name>
<a:Code>eRT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Estimated restoration time last provided to customer.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o3476">
<a:ObjectID>41163B98-FE14-4F9F-8AD4-AF47D5F1AA0A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>typeOfCommunication</a:Name>
<a:Code>typeOfCommunication</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Communication from a customer may be via telephone call, email, written letter, etc.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:InitialValue>call</a:InitialValue>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o3456">
<a:ObjectID>71C0947A-8BC1-4794-BE59-256D33EFFD8F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Outage</a:Name>
<a:Code>Outage</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> A planned outage involves network operations which will affect the supply of power to customers.

Note that the list of Power System Resources for the Outage may be the same or a superset of the ones per OutageStep.  
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o3477">
<a:ObjectID>B11F1E76-E8B3-4EBE-9586-EBE9D4A6D83E</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>outageType</a:Name>
<a:Code>outageType</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:DataType>OutageType</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o3455">
<a:ObjectID>A728B577-7B24-4D59-A856-95F681179A34</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>OutageNotification</a:Name>
<a:Code>OutageNotification</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment> A document containing information to be sent to customers notifying that an outage will take place. This is used to generate mailing lists for customers.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o3451">
<a:ObjectID>866D01DE-05E7-4028-8BA3-A218066FE0B5</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>ComplianceEvent</a:Name>
<a:Code>ComplianceEvent</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Compliance events are used for reporting regulatory or contract compliance issues and/or variances.  These might be created as a consequence of local business processes and associated rules. 

Note: it is anticipated that this class will be customised extensively to meet local implementation needs.
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o3478">
<a:ObjectID>85CD1AC8-8980-4641-B700-0F67967C4E0D</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>complianceType</a:Name>
<a:Code>complianceType</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Type of compliance event indicating, for example, types of regulatory and/or contractual compliance events where expected performance will not be met or reported as mandated.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o3479">
<a:ObjectID>014BE624-8BEF-4790-ADED-3990933C6C0A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>deadline</a:Name>
<a:Code>deadline</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The deadline for compliance.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AbsoluteDateTime</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o3453">
<a:ObjectID>133CEB06-EA36-4E74-A131-30F33E37BF9C</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>OutageType</a:Name>
<a:Code>OutageType</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>This is an Enumeration type of class which is used to represent different type of outages.

The following enumerations are provided:

Fixed: the outage can not be rescheduled before actual start date is assigned
Flexible: the outage can be rescheduled
Forced: unforeseen interruption in equipment service


</a:Comment>
<a:Stereotype>Enumeration</a:Stereotype>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o3480">
<a:ObjectID>A4F7A385-289A-449F-8B95-65207D80105B</a:ObjectID>
