<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Relationship under a particular name, usually evidenced by  a deposit against which withdrawals can be made.  Types of bank accounts include: demand, time, custodial, joint, trustee, corporate, special, and regular accounts.
A statement of transactions during a fiscal period and the resulting balance is maintained on each account.

</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
