<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The result of a maintenance activity, a type of Procedure, for a given attribute of an asset is documentated in an MaintenanceDataSet. </a:Comment>
