<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A GML observation models the act of observing, often with a camera, a person or some form of instrument. An observation feature describes the &quot;metadata&quot; associated with an information capture event, together with with a value for the result of the observation. The basic structures introduced in this class are intended to serve as the foundation for more comprehensive schemas for scientific, technical and engineering measurement schemas.
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
