<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The location property describes the generalized location of the feature.  Note that the value of the location property is a complex type but is not an arbitrary GML object.The location of a GML feature can be a geometry, a location string or a location keyword.</a:Comment>
<a:Stereotype>GML</a:Stereotype>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
