<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>This diagram shows all classes included in the Production package that are needed by both Hydro and Thernal generation. It also shows key external classes that have associations with Production classes.</a:Comment>
