<c:Classes>
<o:Class Id="o7862">
<a:ObjectID>C55A4C9B-AA39-4DCB-8FE7-93B6B8890B95</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>AncillaryService</a:Name>
<a:Code>AncillaryService</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>All of these services relate 
to various aspects of insuring that the production of energy matches consumption of energy at any given time.  They are very critical to the security and reliability of the interconnected network. Some examples of AncillaryServices include Operating/Supplemental Reserve, Energy Imbalance Service, Operating/Spinning Reserve, Reactive Supply and Voltage Control, and Regulation and Frequency Response.
</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o7864">
<a:ObjectID>C03EE57F-D6B6-4B5D-B10D-20A4EAB3AB6A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>TransmissionService</a:Name>
<a:Code>TransmissionService</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Transmission products along posted transmission path.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o7866">
<a:ObjectID>573EEEFB-AF10-42A2-9FFE-FC11573CA4C9</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>TransmissionPath</a:Name>
<a:Code>TransmissionPath</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An electrical connection, link, or line consisting of one or more parallel transmission elements between two areas of the interconnected electric systems, or portions thereof. TransmissionCorridor and TransmissionRightOfWay refer to legal aspects. The TransmissionPath refers to the segments between a TransmissionProvider&#39;s ServicePoints.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o7872">
<a:ObjectID>28E07452-3482-4A9B-B528-7D47008E0A69</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>availTransferCapability</a:Name>
<a:Code>availTransferCapability</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The available transmission capability of a transmission path for the reference direction</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ActivePower</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o7873">
<a:ObjectID>EBA436B4-62F6-4B94-80F3-E7DFA3DF8261</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>parallelPathFlag</a:Name>
<a:Code>parallelPathFlag</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Flag which indicates if the transmission path is also a designated interconnection &quot;parallel path&quot;
</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Boolean</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o7874">
<a:ObjectID>D6DAB56D-8168-4267-B842-BA6D2CCD74D6</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>totalTransferCapability</a:Name>
<a:Code>totalTransferCapability</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The total transmission capability of a transmission path in the reference direction</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ActivePower</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o7868">
<a:ObjectID>0ADE770F-A44E-4575-AA9F-CBEDAE456664</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>ServicePoint</a:Name>
<a:Code>ServicePoint</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Each ServicePoint is contained within (or on the boundary of) an ElectronicIinterchangeArea. ServicePoints are defined termination points of a transmission path (down to distribution level or to a customer - generation or consumption or both). </a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o7863">
<a:ObjectID>75BD1350-7EAC-404A-927D-989B528A15ED</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>ServiceReservation</a:Name>
<a:Code>ServiceReservation</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A ServiceReservation is a reservation for either AncillaryServices or TransmissionServices. In the case of TransmissionServices, this is the right to some amount of AvailableTransmissionCapacity for a product on a path in a direction for some specific period of time</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o7867">
<a:ObjectID>1E17FBD2-8E62-45F3-920B-34381B91032F</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>TiePoint</a:Name>
<a:Code>TiePoint</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Site of an interface between interchange areas. The tie point can be a network branch (e.g., transmission line or transformer) or a switching device. For transmission lines, the interchange area boundary is usually at a designated point such as the middle of the line. Line end metering is then corrected for line losses.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o7875">
<a:ObjectID>F55A2324-8292-4241-A5D7-AF3FAE81F851</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>tiePointMWRating</a:Name>
<a:Code>tiePointMWRating</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The MW rating of the tie point</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ActivePower</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o7870">
<a:ObjectID>5B572529-3533-438B-8AF9-9CF19C1D1EAF</a:ObjectID>
