<c:Classes>
<o:Class Id="o8666">
<a:ObjectID>1912E7FB-408F-4375-A391-F6CE140D6D4D</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>IntSchedAgreement</a:Name>
<a:Code>IntSchedAgreement</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A type of agreement that provides the default method by which interchange schedules are to be integrated to obtain hourly MWh schedules for accounting. </a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o8674">
<a:ObjectID>2DDAA356-8C14-4254-B478-0AE1B4C3C4A0</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>defaultIntegrationMethod</a:Name>
<a:Code>defaultIntegrationMethod</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The default method by which interchange schedules are to be integrated to obtain hourly MWh schedules for accounting. Method #1 is to integrate the instantaneous schedule between the hourly boundaries. Method #2 compensates for any up/down ramping that occurs across the hourly boundary (this is called block accounting).</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>EnumeratedType</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8665">
<a:ObjectID>BEA14569-A14B-43D7-89F0-A0A402652F15</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>GenerationProvider</a:Name>
<a:Code>GenerationProvider</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The energy seller in the energy marketplace.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8663">
<a:ObjectID>4A2DA9AE-A9E2-4401-A2B3-360705F9EB43</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>ControlAreaOperator</a:Name>
<a:Code>ControlAreaOperator</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Operates the Control Area. Approves and implements energy transactions. Verifies both Inter-Control Area and Intra-Control Area transactions for the power system  before granting approval (and implementing) the transactions.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8661">
<a:ObjectID>624A7ED5-6A9F-48A7-920E-CC5DF2B52A44</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>TransmissionProvider</a:Name>
<a:Code>TransmissionProvider</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Provider of  the transmission capacity (interconnecting wires between Generation and Consumption) required  to fulfill and Energy Transaction&#39;s energy exchange. Posts information for transmission paths and AvailableTransmissionCapacities  on a reservation node.  Buys and sells its products and services on the same reservation node.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8660">
<a:ObjectID>E55C27DD-42DE-4974-A5E8-EF182E152C88</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>CustomerConsumer</a:Name>
<a:Code>CustomerConsumer</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The energy buyer in the energy marketplace.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8664">
<a:ObjectID>91339087-3093-4D33-A1BE-78D04127883D</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Marketer</a:Name>
<a:Code>Marketer</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Matches buyers and sellers, and secures transmission (and other ancillary services) needed to complete the energy transaction.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8662">
<a:ObjectID>A2AA6F75-F6CF-456A-81F8-5684B1405617</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>TransmissionProduct</a:Name>
<a:Code>TransmissionProduct</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o8675">
<a:ObjectID>E32397E9-0D90-421A-AE2E-4F33FA1D7FFB</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>transmissionProductType</a:Name>
<a:Code>transmissionProductType</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Type of the transmission product. This could be a transmission service class (firm, total transmission capability, or non-firm), transmission service period (on-peak, full-period, off-peak), transmission service increments (yearly extended, hourly fixed, monthly sliding, etc.), transmission service type (network, available transmission capability, or point-to-point, or a transmission service window (fixed hourly, sliding weekly, extended monthly, etc.).</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>EnumeratedType</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8659">
<a:ObjectID>E479E85C-C65F-4693-9AAD-D4BDCDD03685</a:ObjectID>
