<o:Class Id="o8810">
<a:ObjectID>A70D20C2-5506-417E-87C3-F53E2DBEAA2A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>InadvertentAccount</a:Name>
<a:Code>InadvertentAccount</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An account for tracking inadvertent interchange versus time for each control area. A control area may have more than one inadvertent account in order to track inadvertent over one or more specific tie points in addition to the usual overall net inadvertent. Separate accounts would also be used to track designated time periods, such as on-peak and off-peak.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8803">
<a:ObjectID>09B88BF4-B764-40BE-B38F-4DCEFEFDF496</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>AreaReserveSpec</a:Name>
<a:Code>AreaReserveSpec</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The control area&#39;s reserve specification</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o8836">
<a:ObjectID>6D9EB4FB-0A6E-4120-B89F-580966DED88A</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>areaReserveSpecName</a:Name>
<a:Code>areaReserveSpecName</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The Identification or name of the control area&#39;s reserve specification.  A particular specification could correspond to pre-defined power system conditions, e.g., emergency situations.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>String</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o8837">
<a:ObjectID>3FD4E249-8771-4154-B818-2ED8889CEB88</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>lowerRegMarginReqt</a:Name>
<a:Code>lowerRegMarginReqt</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Lower regulating margin requirement in MW, the amount of generation that can be dropped by control in 10 minutes</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ActivePower</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o8838">
<a:ObjectID>7897282F-F6AF-42D0-9FD7-F171DBC410E6</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>opReserveReqt</a:Name>
<a:Code>opReserveReqt</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Operating reserve requirement in MW, where operating reserve is the generating capability that is fully available within 30 minutes. Operating reserve is composed of primary reserve (t less than 10 min) and secondary reserve (10 less than t less than 30 min).</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ActivePower</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o8839">
<a:ObjectID>997DA7B3-5EB0-4040-AF49-9B6EAEFC9863</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>primaryReserveReqt</a:Name>
<a:Code>primaryReserveReqt</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Primary reserve requirement in MW, where primary reserve is generating capability that is fully available within 10 minutes. Primary reserve is composed of spinning reserve and quick-start reserve.</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ActivePower</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o8840">
<a:ObjectID>526C7ACF-FED7-4F32-8BCE-132215C8760D</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>raiseRegMarginReqt</a:Name>
<a:Code>raiseRegMarginReqt</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Raise regulating margin requirement in MW, the amount of generation that can be picked up by control in 10 minutes</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ActivePower</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o8841">
<a:ObjectID>69605593-83C8-47DB-BDAC-4262D9D228D7</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>spinningReserveReqt</a:Name>
<a:Code>spinningReserveReqt</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Spinning reserve requirement in MW, spinning reserve is generating capability that is presently synchronized to the network and is fully available within 10 minutes</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>ActivePower</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8813">
<a:ObjectID>68CD8B8B-5F0A-40D5-A685-12A630AAD7A9</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>HostControlArea</a:Name>
<a:Code>HostControlArea</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A HostControlArea has a set of tie points and a set of generator controls (i.e., AGC). It also has a total load, including transmission and distribution losses.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
<c:Attributes>
<o:Attribute Id="o8842">
<a:ObjectID>DC150103-11A2-4609-85CE-CF80A24CE998</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>areaControlMode</a:Name>
<a:Code>areaControlMode</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The area&#39;s present control mode: (CF = constant frequency) or (CTL = constant tie-line) or (TLB = tie-line bias) or (OFF = off control)</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>AreaControlMode</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o8843">
<a:ObjectID>BC3CDA8E-BD4F-4D11-8CF3-26383208B006</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>freqSetPoint</a:Name>
<a:Code>freqSetPoint</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The present power system frequency set point for automatic generation control</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>Frequency</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
<o:Attribute Id="o8844">
<a:ObjectID>33D71FF4-D7B7-44AA-8BA6-758C98B2999E</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>frequencyBiasFactor</a:Name>
<a:Code>frequencyBiasFactor</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>The control area&#39;s frequency bias factor, in MW/0.1 Hz, for automatic generation control (AGC)</a:Comment>
<a:DataType>FreqBiasFactor</a:DataType>
<a:Persistent>0</a:Persistent>
</o:Attribute>
</c:Attributes>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8807">
<a:ObjectID>0945B112-8F05-40A1-9E60-93F6A81E20B5</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>EnergyProduct</a:Name>
<a:Code>EnergyProduct</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>An EnergyProduct is offered commercially as a ContractOrTariff.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8805">
<a:ObjectID>9AF6798A-D437-49EF-9FB8-8F9165089C15</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>EnergyProfile</a:Name>
<a:Code>EnergyProfile</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Specifies the start time, stop time, level for an EnergyTransaction.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8808">
<a:ObjectID>B878A3F1-4702-465A-9314-6683E6FCBC22</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>LossProfile</a:Name>
<a:Code>LossProfile</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>LossProfile is associated with an EnerrgyTransaction and must be completely contained within the time frame of the EnergyProfile associated with this EnergyTransaction.</a:Comment>
<a:UseParentNamespace>0</a:UseParentNamespace>
<a:Persistence>T</a:Persistence>
<a:Cardinality>*</a:Cardinality>
</o:Class>
<o:Class Id="o8806">
<a:ObjectID>FB03D46D-114A-4CEE-AA68-E8FFBC93D6B9</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>CurtailmentProfile</a:Name>
<a:Code>CurtailmentProfile</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1202478865</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>sechin</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1202478865</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>sechin</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Curtailing entity must be providing at least one service to the EnergyTransaction. The CurtailmentProfile must be completely contained within the EnergyProfile timeframe for this EnergyTransaction.</a:Comment>
